Package: fastrdp-freerdp3
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: FreeRDP 3 build used by fastrdp (private, in /opt/fastrdp)
 FreeRDP is a free implementation of the Remote Desktop Protocol.
 .
 This is the FreeRDP release that fastrdp is built and tested against, with
 the fastrdp patches (patches/freerdp in the fast-rdp-server sources) that
 are not yet in an upstream release. Everything lives under /opt/fastrdp:
 libraries, freerdp-proxy, the xfreerdp client (H.264 via FFmpeg), headers
 and pkg-config files (for building the fastrdp proxy module).
 .
 It coexists with the distribution's freerdp3 packages, which
 gnome-remote-desktop and KRdp keep using.
